+// 802403C0 (N4's n2h_802403C0, native_n2.cpp, rewritten in host single precision; same control flow, inst_count
+// and stack frame handling): curve with 32-bit keys {frame: top 12 bits / u8 for the search (GQR2), value: 12
+// bits (GQR3), slope: signed 12 bits (GQR6)} after {u16 count; f32 s4, scale, offset}. The FPRs as floats with
